                "@type": "Answer",
                "text": "No US federal regulation requires it for general NDT service work. It is driven by client and market demand instead — owner-operators, EPCs and government buyers increasingly specify it during prequalification, and it is standard for bodies performing regulated inspection in Europe and the Middle East. ANAB operates an NDE-specific inspection body accreditation programme under the standard for organisations that want it."
