                "text": "It fits poorly. LIMS platforms model samples that arrive, are tested and are disposed of, which suits ISO/IEC 17025 laboratories. Clause 3.1 defines inspection as examination of an item and determination of its conformity, including on the basis of professional judgement against general requirements. Items are inspected in place across years, and the record is positional and longitudinal rather than sample-based and terminal."
