                "text": "The operations manager builds it and the finance function reviews it. Operations holds the report count, the reject history and the mobilisation record; finance holds the loaded labour rate and the threshold the case must clear. If the model is built entirely by whoever wants the software, it will not be believed. If it is built entirely by finance, the operational inputs will be wrong. Build it jointly."
