          "@type": "TechArticle",
          "headline": "Inspection management software for API 510, 570 and 653 contractors: what the owner-side systems leave out",
          "description": "Prometheus/VisualAIM, MISTRAS PCMS and Codeware INSPECT carry deep API code logic for asset owners. Quoting, dispatch, certification currency and client segregation are on you.",
