                "text": "No. AS9100 is an aerospace quality management system standard covering the whole business. AC7114 is Nadcap special process audit criteria covering nondestructive testing specifically, assessed by PRI against your written practice, your personnel records, your procedures and observed work. A shop holds AS9100 certification and still fails an AC7114 audit on personnel records, because AS9100 auditors sample the NDT programme lightly while an AC7114 assessor does nothing else for the duration of the visit."
